        "height": 716,
        "content": "## **AI Lead Capture & Qualification**\n\n**WHAT'S NEW vs. the basic version**\n1. Hosted form portal (no external form tool needed)\n2. Email validation and free email detection\n3. Duplicate lead check before processing\n4. Company enrichment before scoring\n5. Smarter AI prompt (budget, timeline, domain quality)\n6. 3 way routing: Hot / Warm / Cold\n7. Instant AI auto reply to every valid lead\n8. Automated nurture follow up for Warm leads\n9. Slack and email alerts for Hot leads\n10. Error handling wired across every critical node\n\n**SETUP**\n☐ Connect OpenAI\n☐ Connect Google Sheets (2 columns needed: lookup and log)\n☐ Connect Gmail\n☐ Connect Slack (Hot lead channel)\n☐ Publish the form and share its URL\n\n**CUSTOMIZE**\n- Scoring weights in the AI system prompt\n- Nurture wait time (default 3 days)\n- Swap Clearbit enrichment for Apollo or Clearbit Enrichment API with your own key"
